Package: lineageR
Title: Dataset Lineage and Provenance Tracking for Ontology-Backed Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("lineageR", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lineager@example.com")
Description: Register data sources, transforms, and their dependencies to build
    a lineage DAG for ontology-backed object types. Query provenance (what sources
    feed this table?), impact (what objects are affected by this source?), and
    freshness (when was each step last run?).
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    DBI,
    igraph,
    dplyr,
    rlang,
    jsonlite,
    cli
Suggests:
    ontologySpecR,
    duckdb,
    visNetwork,
    ggraph,
    ggplot2,
    targets,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
